The SingleDatabaseManager class is internal, so I cannot instantiate it directly in a test outside the assembly. Also, the method TaskCheckpointBasedOnAofSizeLimitAsync is not virtual, and the logger is passed as a parameter, so I can test the logging by passing a mock ILogger.

I will create a test class inside the Garnet.server namespace to access internal types and test the logging call by passing a mock ILogger. I will mock or fake the dependencies minimally to trigger the log call on line 226.

I will submit a test file with a test class in the Garnet.server namespace that tests the logging call in TaskCheckpointBasedOnAofSizeLimitAsync.

